- ## What the alternative costs
+ ## Quanto custa a alternativa

- The same types, written conventionally:
+ Os mesmos tipos, escritos da maneira convencional:

= The same types, written conventionally:
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= The same types, written conventionally:
=
